    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(3rd Level)</em></p><p><em>Names matter. You remove them.</em></p><p>Once per Soma Break:</p><p>Choose a creature or effect and strip one semantic label:</p><ul><li><p>Undead</p></li><li><p>Summoned</p></li><li><p>Magical</p></li><li><p>Hostile</p></li><li><p>Protected</p></li><li><p>Etc.</p></li></ul><p>For a short duration, abilities that rely on that label:</p><ul><li><p>Fail</p></li><li><p>Treat the target as invalid</p></li><li><p>Lose their trigger condition</p></li></ul><p>This is loud magic.</p><p>the misfire ladder applies at full weight.</p><p>You did not change the thing.</p><p>You changed what it counts as.</p><p></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
